{"server":"tw","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_02_end","groupId":"act40side","stageId":"act40side_02","title":"糖瓜黏","storyCode":"OR-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"195913388ed71cd699837b252b8924b5c24aa27b32c51f850d2de3bbb6dbecfd","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g2_downtownarea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐，這個味道怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……嗯……還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說……這家的桔紅酥，是你印象裡的那種味道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像……還是不太一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是沒有我吃過的甜，口感也有些區別……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，這家一心坊的點心，做法應該是最傳統的，近一百年都沒有變過才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——啊，一百年？這道點心有那麼久的歷史嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有那麼久，但在百灶，這樣能叫得上名字的點心，或多或少都能追溯到一些歷史的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐在找的這種桔紅酥，其實就是早年間，一位進京求學的書生發明的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那書生的故鄉盛產柑桔，他在百灶的時候，懷念故鄉物產，但路途遙遠，不能輕易吃到，於是他便發明了一種點心的做法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將陳年桔皮碾碎，和進做月餅的酥皮裡，只加少量佐料，簡單烘烤。這種做法成本極低，而且做出來的點心真的有一股柑桔的香味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"書生把這種配方賣給住宿的旅店換取生活費，還為這點心寫了句詩，“遙知桔林染，鄉心一點紅”。所以，這種點心就叫桔紅酥了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來這位書生考校高中，這道桔紅酥便被眾人所知，在流傳的過程中，也被賦予了“思鄉”或“思念”的含義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"象徵思念……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食物象徵一種情感……這還從來沒有聽說過，唔……有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，炎國幅員遼闊，不同地區的氣候、物產天差地別，也因此誕生了不同的菜系。這一道道菜品，說是炎國民生的歷史書也不為過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像以炎國四大菜系為特色，大名鼎鼎的“四大名樓”，在百灶還不是移動城市的時候就有啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城市發展日新月異，但是一些味道卻總能留下來，所以一道流行過的點心在歷史裡完全找不到蹤跡，那才是怪事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽同事說過，炎國天師分類很多，你懂得這麼多，你該不會是什麼“美食天師”吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗……要是真的有人的源石技藝可以“點石成菜”，那說不定還蠻值得研究的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我只是一個愛好者罷了，平時習慣將美食相關的所見所聞都用筆記下來。時間長了，記得的也就多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來，煌小姐，如果像你說的，真有能讓點心變得更好吃的一種配方，那它不該不為人知啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我總記得，小時候吃到的桔紅酥，就是要更甜更香一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就有點奇怪了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳統桔紅酥的做法，講究不見桔子的果肉但能吃出桔子的香氣，所以對糖的用量非常克制，是種口味比較清淡的點心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可煌小姐說的桔紅酥加了很多糖……我也沒有聽說過有哪家的桔紅酥做了這種改動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我們可以委託一位點心師傅，讓他試試多放糖呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是這樣也沒辦法證明我吃過的那種桔紅酥曾經確實存在過吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是很想知道，這種點心從百灶到維多利亞，怎麼就變了味……背後一定有故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來煌小姐的愛好，和我是一樣的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還擔心，帶著你走了這麼多地方，你會不耐煩呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來就是拜託你帶我在百灶旅遊的，你怎麼還和我客氣上了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我們再多去找找吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過時間也不早了，我們先去吃午飯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？午飯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了飯點，可不就該吃午飯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我們剛剛才去過五家點心店啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎麼能一樣，點心是點心，不能當正餐的啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的肚子，已經滿了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵……我知道一家小店，保證不會讓你的肚子遭罪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐願意賞光嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你都這麼說了，那我當然就“捨肚子陪君子”啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總覺得……有人在跟著我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g3_baizaomainstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是……禁軍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜然的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要誤會，不著玄鐵甲，我還不屬於正式禁軍。只論官職，我是隸屬於御林衛的校將。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜然的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿應該也不會想去做那個在光天化日之下見到玄鐵甲的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我聽太合提起過，禁軍學徒中有一位翹楚，年紀輕輕，實力已遠超同僚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是那位小教頭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，不過是比武輸給我幾次，他也不用這麼惦記著，倒顯得小氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閒話先放放……我想問問，麟少卿為何在此處？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……查案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查的案子是與退休的禮部尚書有關？大理寺批搜查令了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小教頭的職責，應該不是監督大理寺如何辦案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的職責，你還沒有權限過問。回答我的問題就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……自然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說麟少卿之前出公差，離開過百灶好一陣子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的確，為查一樁舊案找尋證人，補全檔案資料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何時的舊案？什麼樣的證人，為何現在才去尋找？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小教頭一連串問題，倒是讓我聽不明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"御林衛要是想要調查大理寺的工作，我這便回去整理文檔，即刻上交。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你還不放心，我也可以請大理寺卿大人親自來解答御林衛的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的問題與大理寺無關，只關乎麟少卿一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿追查這樁舊案，查到什麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……時間太久，線索又模糊，最終一無所獲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當真一無所獲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的確一無所獲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我相信麟少卿。不過也請麟少卿想明白，對御林衛的問題給出的答案，意味著什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……公事的話，就說到這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小教頭的意思是，還有私事要聊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太合那個笨牛說過，他在官場上的朋友並不多，你可以算一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以想奉勸你……莫立危牆之下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小教頭應該是多慮了。大理寺的少卿在的地方，應當只有疑案和真相，沒有什麼危牆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁軍小教頭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見到太合，替我問好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說我不該在這裡，禁軍學徒，御林衛的人又為何在這裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這不正說明，我找對方向了嗎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g3_baizaomainstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滿足滿足，我還真沒想過，路邊攤的一碗餛飩能做得這麼好吃，和羅德島餐廳冰櫃裡的冷凍餛飩完全不一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胃裡暖和，渾身都暖洋洋的。真想就地睡一覺，啊——唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃了那麼多點心，用一碗清湯餛飩換個口味解解膩再適合不過啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些遠近聞名的大酒樓自然不用我多介紹，煌小姐難得來一次百灶，我當然要帶你品嚐一下我的私人珍藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我運氣還真好，能遇到這麼懂行的導遊，多謝你啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實……我也難得找到一個可以一起吃飯的人。平時自己一個人吃飯，從來不敢多點菜呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那現在正好啦，我們一塊吃的時候，你想吃幾道就點幾道，不怕吃不完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，這餛飩裡包的是什麼？味道這麼神奇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這餛飩的餡，就是簡單的獸肉和芹菜，但這餛飩的妙處，其實是在湯裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一般餛飩湯的做法，是使用殼獸籽來提鮮。這樣做固然可以，但殼獸的葷腥味，多少會擠佔其他食材的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的做法，卻是用黃豆芽來吊湯。新鮮的豆芽，自帶一絲鮮味，味道不算突出，放在餛飩的清湯裡卻是正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"包餛飩用的肉餡用肥瘦三七分的新鮮五花肉，餛飩煮熟後，點點油花自然就滲進了湯裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣做出來的餛飩，口味清淡，味道極鮮。只是對每樣食材本身品質的要求很高，別處可是輕易吃不到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這碗餛飩，是不是也有什麼來歷？跟我講講吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實也沒什麼，這只是我常常會來的一家小店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寫作不順、心情不好、沒有胃口的時候，我都會來這裡吃一碗餛飩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的店主婆婆做了一輩子餛飩。這家小店，原本是由夫妻二人共同經營的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來婆婆的丈夫病逝了，婆婆便一個人照顧孩子。之後那個孩子投身軍伍，幾年前犧牲在了北邊的一場天災裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今婆婆一個人還在堅持開這家小店，她說，想要留住屬於他們一家人的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……還真是，很遺憾啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"悲歡離合，人生多的是遺憾，香椿和秋芹，畢竟不可兼得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來這裡的次數多了，偶爾也會幫婆婆一點忙，後來婆婆把她的秘方告訴我，還叮囑我說，要在她去世以後，替她把這份手藝傳下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，我有件事想問問煌小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐這樣費力地找那種桔紅酥，真的只是因為和那位小大廚打了一個賭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼突然問起這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛注意到，煌小姐似乎並沒有很在意點心的口味，倒像是有什麼別的心事的樣子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？這你都看出來了？有那麼明顯嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個人在吃飯的時候，心事可是藏不住的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，只是有些好奇，如果涉及隱秘，煌小姐不便告知——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也沒什麼……這一路下來，感覺沒必要對你遮掩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得對，我確實沒那麼在乎那個賭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實那種桔紅酥，是……我爸在百灶的時候，常常寄給我的點心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐的父親，是炎國人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……算了，也沒什麼好隱瞞的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在維多利亞長大的，我爸卻是大炎人。有一年，他好像因為什麼事，又回到了炎國。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果這一去十幾年，直到他死在異國他鄉，我都沒有再見過他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，煌小姐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，又不是你的錯，怎麼反而還道歉個沒完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來也沒覺得這是多麼特殊的事，可是昨天聽說那種味道的桔紅酥很特殊，我就想，或許會做那個點心的人，認識我爸呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐的父親也是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒……沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，既然有這層緣由，煌小姐，在下一定竭盡全力幫你找到相關的線索——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這人好奇怪，吃飯的時候豪爽，講話的時候像大家閨秀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明是一起大吃大喝的朋友，怎麼一放下筷子就變得這麼客氣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，那你呢？你又為什麼要陪我找點心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，我想寫一部書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今能見到的美食書，大都只記載名家名廚的菜譜，可是市井民間明明也藏著許多獨一無二的美食，卻少有人問津。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想把這些味道都記錄下來，或許多年以後，人們看到這本書，也能窺見百灶風貌的一角……只是一個自負的妄想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是先保密吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g2_downtownarea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了對了，反正都出來玩了，不如你帶我去幾個地方吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，你想去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我看看……信上寫的，明德書局、守拙園，還有百灶學宮……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……這個字是什麼意思來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以讓我看看嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是信？哎呀，怎麼還沾了這麼多油？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不是我弄的！信寄過來的時候就已經是這樣了。我也不知道我爸當時是怎麼搞的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些信，都是你父親寄給你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，家裡還完好保存著的，就這幾封了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（奇怪，這信紙不是……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒，沒什麼……只是這信上寫的這些地點大多已經消失不見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不見了？這不過才十幾年吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十幾年，對百灶來說，也夠城市變幾番樣貌了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來到百灶後，你有沒有發現什麼不同？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了吃的東西……就是這隨處可見的能源樁了……要消耗這麼多能源，有點太奢侈了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是奢侈，更像是“不得已而為之”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百灶建城之初，要追溯到很久遠的時候……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時的炎國剛經歷過一場大戰，國家百廢待興，但就在一片戰場的廢墟旁，人們發現了一條極為富饒的源石礦脈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼巧？你們炎國人運氣也太好了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，一點也不好。那條源石礦脈固然富饒，可就是因為太富饒了，極易吸引源石微粒繼續在此聚集，引發天災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，它不僅難以開採，還會讓方圓百公里的土地都變成天災頻發的地區。對此，當時的人們束手無策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到有一位天師提議，既然富饒的礦脈會造成天災，那直接把城市建在礦脈上，讓高耗能的設施去消耗它不就好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把城市建造在源石礦上？這不是找死嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的確是一個非常冒險的做法，不過當時的真龍採納了這一諫言，炎國也的確這麼做了。後來，就有了百灶這座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法想像……那時候的人們到底是怎麼做到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我也不是很清楚，關於那一段歷史，史書上只有一句話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“……遣能人異士先赴災域，歷五十三載，城成，定都。取照拂天下煙火之意，賜名百灶。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於更詳細的技術，恐怕就只有在天師府的高級教材上才能看到了，不過那就不是我瞭解的領域啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以時至今日，百灶依然鼓勵將這些能源善加利用的行為……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座百灶城，幾乎是一刻不停地發生著改變，你看到的這些高樓大廈，還有望不到頭的移動地塊，都是這樣來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些參與建造城市的人，後來怎麼樣了……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g03_yandowntown_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肚子是塞滿了，可是該找的味道還是沒有找到啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的點心鋪子的確已經吃遍了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許，明天我們再去一些酒樓裡找找，說不定還有一些點心師傅藏在……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說什麼來著，我說什麼來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找了一整天，可找到你說的正宗桔紅酥了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直在跟著我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怕我們真的找到手藝比你好的廚師吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怕？怎麼可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早就告訴過你們，全百灶手藝最好的廚師就在你們眼前。我不會做的菜，別人更不會做；我這裡都吃不到的味道，別處更吃不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐，我吃過這位小大廚做的菜。他的手藝的確是精妙，非一般人能及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……你倒是會說話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，你們爭論的只是一道點心有做法上的差異，又怎會成為評判一位廚師廚藝高下的標準呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過先生，其實你也很好奇，煌小姐說的那種桔紅酥的配方，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……也沒有多想知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如這樣，你們的賭局先作罷，我們商議一下，還有哪裡可能找得到那種味道的桔紅酥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐找到了想找的點心，先生也多知曉了一種配方，這不是兩全其美的事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……你……啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我的一個月飯票怎麼算——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，雖說我的廚藝已經是出神入化無人能及，但除我之外，也不全是泛泛之輩。要說有那麼一手絕活，能讓我高看一眼的，也就……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一定要說的話……也就是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百灶四大名樓，排名頭一號的鼎豐樓，他們的總廚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說，莫不服，莫先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鼎豐樓最近忙著承辦今年的百珍宴，這應該是老頭子參加的最後一屆了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一屆？他這是打算要退休了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道呢！這老頭子最近四處下戰書，真顯得他威風了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那還等什麼！我們這就去找他啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒那麼簡單……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫大廚身分非比尋常，尤其最近還要負責國宴，只是為一道點心去找他，根本是不可能的事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘倒是機靈，不過話只說對了一半。如果你們真的想去見他，我倒是有一個辦法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上個月的發票？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，不是這個口袋裡的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這回沒錯了，看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鼎豐樓廚師選拔賽的請帖……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌小姐，眼下想見到莫大廚，這確實是個不多得的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那還等什麼，你們誰去參賽，帶我一個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於參賽人選嘛……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你看我做什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
